              "value": "{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\sqrt{3}}^{\\sqrt{3}}{r}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta ",
